Query:
-- 9. Compare Westminster with another borough for “Other Theft”
SELECT year,
       SUM(CASE WHEN borough = 'Westminster' THEN value END) AS westminster_cnt,
       SUM(CASE WHEN borough = 'Camden'      THEN value END) AS camden_cnt
FROM `bigquery-public-data.london_crime.crime_by_lsoa`
WHERE major_category = 'Theft and Handling'
  AND minor_category = 'Other Theft'
  AND borough IN ('Westminster', 'Camden')
GROUP BY year
ORDER BY year
LIMIT 20;
Answer:
year,westminster_cnt,camden_cnt
